WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.300
I was the third stage of a giant Saturn V rocket.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
After I sent Apollo 16 toward the Moon, I was supposed to crash where the seismometers could feel me.

3
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:25.190
I went quiet before I hit, and nobody knew where I landed… until a spacecraft spotted my crater 43 years later.

4
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.280
I hid my crater for 43 years.
